			I’m Siyuan Wang (王思远), a PhD student in Computer Science at Shanghai Jiao Tong University, advised by
			Prof. Dongyao Chen. I design systems at the intersection of <strong>mobile sensing & HCI</strong> and
			<strong>long-context LLMs</strong>, aiming to make intelligent interactions more robust and practical.
		</p>

		<h2>Work & Research</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>PhD Research — Mobile sensing + HCI: μTouch (PerCom 2026) explores passive magnetic self-touch sensing with semi-supervised gesture recognition.</li>
			<li>Research Intern, Microsoft Research Asia — Long-context LLMs: LoongRL (ICLR 2026) and LongRoPE2 (ICML 2025) on reasoning and context scaling.</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Side Projects</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>Kaggle LMSYS “Chatbot Arena” human preference prediction — Silver medal (39/1849 teams).</li>
